    "bodyText": "\r\n\t\t\t\t{{announDetailData.InfoTitle}}\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t{{announDetailData.Media}}|{{announDetailData.InfoPublDate}}\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n          {{cont}}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t新华财经声明：本文内容仅供参考，不构成投资建议。投资者据此操作，风险自担。\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t",
